Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.41,0:00:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, dark day\N♪ 噢，黑暗之日 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.14,0:00:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Was I just someone to dominate?\N♪ 难道我只是供你支配的玩物？ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.46,0:00:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Worthy opponent, flint to my blade\N♪ 可敬的对手，如燧石擦亮我的锋芒 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.49,0:00:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we're playing with shadows\N♪ 如今我们与虚影共舞 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.14,0:00:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,At the Sunset Tower\N♪ 在日落塔酒店 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.69,0:00:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You said, "Open your mouth", I did\N♪ 你说“张开嘴吧”，我照做了 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.35,0:00:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And what came spillin' out that day was the truth\N♪ 那日倾泻而出的尽是真相 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.16,0:01:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'd had virginity, I would have given that too\N♪ 若我尚有童贞，也必献予你 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.13,0:01:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do we run to the ones we do?\N♪ 为何我们总奔向注定伤己之人？ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.39,0:01:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't belong to anyone, ooh\N♪ 我从不属于任何人，呜 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.14,0:01:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, dark day\N♪ 噢，黑暗之日 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.34,0:01:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Was I just young blood to get on tape?\N♪ 难道我只是你镜头下的新鲜血液？ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.74,0:01:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,'Cause you dimed me out when it got hard\N♪ 因困境时你便出卖了我 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.87,0:01:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Uppercut to the throat, I was off guard\N♪ 喉间突遭上勾拳，我猝不及防 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.02,0:01:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Pure heroine mistaken for featherweight\N♪ 纯正女英雄却被误作羽量级 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.66,0:01:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But what came spillin' out that day was the truth\N♪ 但那日倾泻而出的尽是真相 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.31,0:01:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And once I could sing again, I swore I'd never lеt\N♪ 当歌声重回喉间，我立誓永不 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.66,0:02:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let myself sing again for you\N♪ 再为你而歌 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.34,0:02:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh-woah, ooh-woah-oh
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.51,0:02:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing it\N♪ 唱出来吧 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.86,0:02:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Said, "Why do we run to thе ones we do?"\N♪ 问道：“为何总奔向注定伤己之人？” ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.24,0:02:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't belong to anyone, ooh\N♪ 我从不属于任何人，呜 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.11,0:02:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I made you God 'cause it was all\N♪ 我曾奉你为神明，因那曾是 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.96,0:02:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That I knew how to do\N♪ 我唯一所知的方式 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.89,0:02:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't belong to anyone\N♪ 但我不属于任何人 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.14,0:03:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I ever gon' love again?\N♪ 我还能再爱吗？ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.04,0:03:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I ever gon' love again?\N♪ 我还能再爱吗？ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.04,0:03:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I ever gon' love again?\N♪ 我还能再爱吗？ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.71,0:03:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell it to the rock doves\N♪ 去告诉岩鸽吧 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.54,0:03:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing it to the fountain\N♪ 向喷泉吟唱吧 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.84,0:03:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?\N♪ 你可明白？ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.96,0:03:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell it to 'em\n\N♪ 告诉他们吧 ♪\n